      "refersTo": "timeline-panel",
      "description": "Native full-set playback and download on the shared listening surface; static sample has no audio source.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-mix-player\" aria-label=\"Full mix playback\"><div class=\"ds-mix-heading\"><h2>Full mix</h2><a href=\"#\" download>Download MP3</a></div><audio controls preload=\"metadata\" aria-label=\"Full mix playback\"></audio><p>Play the complete set, or jump to a track below.</p></section>",
      "css": ".ds-mix-player{font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;color:var(--text,#fff);background:var(--surface,#111);border-radius:12px;padding:20px}.ds-mix-heading{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:16px}.ds-mix-heading h2{font-size:16px;font-weight:600;margin:0}.ds-mix-heading a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;min-height:38px;padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid var(--control,#444);border-radius:6px;font-size:13px;text-decoration:none;color:var(--text,#fff)}.ds-mix-heading a:hover{background:var(--raised,#242424)}.ds-mix-heading a:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent,#c6f24e);outline-offset:3px}.ds-mix-player audio{display:block;width:100%;height:52px;margin-top:22px;color-scheme:dark}.ds-mix-player p{font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--muted,#b4b4b4);margin:12px 0 0}@media(max-width:650px){.ds-mix-player{padding:18px 14px}.ds-mix-heading{gap:10px}.ds-mix-heading h2{font-size:15px}.ds-mix-heading a{font-size:12px;padding:8px 10px}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Tracklist and transition seek",
      "kind": "custom",
      "description": "Timestamped wrapping track rows and a compact transition action; sample values match the reviewed mix. Seeking is wired by the application.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-listening\"><h2>Tracklist</h2><ol><li><button aria-label=\"Seek to I Move (Lyrics).mp3 at 0:00\"><time>0:00</time><span>I Move (Lyrics).mp3</span></button></li><li><button aria-label=\"Seek to F Say What.mp3 at 1:36\"><time>1:36</time><span>F Say What.mp3</span></button></li></ol><h2 class=\"ds-join-title\">Transitions</h2><button class=\"ds-join\">16-bar controlled blend<small>1:36–2:08 · Jump to the handoff</small></button></section>",
      "css": ".ds-listening{font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;color:var(--text,#fff)}.ds-listening h2{font-size:16px;font-weight:600;margin:0}.ds-listening ol{list-style:none;margin:18px 0 0;padding:0}.ds-listening li{border-bottom:1px solid #252525}.ds-listening button{font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;min-height:38px;border:1px solid var(--control,#444);border-radius:6px;padding:8px 11px;cursor:pointer;background:transparent;color:var(--text,#fff)}.ds-listening li button{display:flex;align-items:baseline;width:100%;gap:16px;text-align:left;border:0;border-radius:0;min-height:60px;padding:12px 0;line-height:1.6}.ds-listening time{color:var(--muted,#b4b4b4);font-size:13px;min-width:40px}.ds-listening li span{overflow-wrap:anywhere;font-size:14px}.ds-listening .ds-join-title{margin-top:30px}.ds-join{display:block;text-align:left;line-height:1.5;margin-top:16px}.ds-join small{display:block;color:var(--muted,#b4b4b4);font-size:12px;margin-top:3px}.ds-listening button:hover{background:var(--raised,#242424)}.ds-listening button:active{background:#333}.ds-listening button:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent,#c6f24e);outline-offset:3px}.ds-listening button:disabled{opacity:.5;cursor:default}@media(max-width:650px){.ds-listening li button{gap:12px}}"
    },
    {
