  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The Low-Light Listening Desk",
    "overview": "AI-DJ is a compact working instrument: true black, flat neutral surfaces, precise timing columns and familiar controls. Its visual language supports sustained listening and direct correction. Musical evidence supplies the visual interest; decoration does not compete with it.\n\nInter carries the entire interface, with tabular numerals keeping times steady. The selected surface direction is Operate: restrained controls and explicit states, with no glow or decorative motion. Mix listening and the timeline editor share this established visual vocabulary; these rules describe the implemented surfaces rather than a complete future mix application.",
